      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "oracle",
          "expected-output"
        ],
        "note": "The 3,521-row expected output at `<outputtimestep value=\"Hour\"/>`: 23 pollutants at START exhaust (process 2), road type 1, every cohort of the seven source-fuel pairs. N2O (602) at the opModeID 100 rate StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator weights at 1 (StartOperatingModeDistributionGenerator.java:434-458), CO2 Equivalent over it, the six ATRatio toxics FuelEffectsGenerator writes from the start strings of generalFuelRatioExpression (2001 and later) and from the Complex Model (2000 and earlier), and the start PM species. Electricity has THC, N2O and CO2 Equivalent rows only (all zero).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
