        "note": "20 rows: CH4 and NMHC from THC, NMOG and VOC from NMHC, TOG from CH4 and NMOG, the six toxics from VOC, and the PM chain (PM10 from PM2.5, PM2.5 from EC and non-EC PM, OC and sulfate from non-EC PM, and the cyclic non-EC PM / sulfate / water edges SulfatePMCalculator splits and re-sums). Atmospheric CO2 and CO2 Equivalent are CO2AE edges MOVES keeps in Java (conventions §78).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
